---
import EventLayout from "../components/layout/EventLayout.astro";
---

<EventLayout title="Call for Speakers — DevFest Bandung 2026">
  <section class="page-hero cfp-hero">
    <div class="wrap cfp-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mono">Call for speakers</div>
        <h1>Speak to the<br /><span class="gradient">whole room.</span></h1>
        <p>Share a practical story, a hard-won technical lesson, or a clear idea that helps developers and builders build, secure, and scale in the agentic era.</p>
        <div class="cfp-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#submission">Submission opens soon →</a>
          <button class="button secondary" data-open-modal type="button">Get CFP updates</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="cfp-banner" aria-label="Sessionize call for speakers notice">
        <div class="mono">Powered by Sessionize</div>
        <h2>Bring the work<br />you want to share.</h2>
        <p>The submission destination will be linked here when the event CFP form is published.</p>
        <a class="sessionize-link" href="https://sessionize.com/brand" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the Sessionize banner reference →</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head cfp-section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mono">What we want to hear</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Useful ideas for the builder era.</h2>
          <p class="section-copy">The approved programme direction gives speakers room to contribute across three complementary experiences.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cfp-grid">
        <article class="cfp-card blue-border"><span class="mono">01 · Builder track</span><h3>Build from the first idea</h3><p>Practical stories about AI-assisted apps, prototypes, products, and the Google ecosystem.</p></article>
        <article class="cfp-card red-border"><span class="mono">02 · Developer track</span><h3>Secure the system</h3><p>Lessons about agents, development, deployment, governance, security, and production readiness.</p></article>
        <article class="cfp-card yellow-border"><span class="mono">03 · Builder Space</span><h3>Make room to try</h3><p>Accessible, hands-on directions that invite curious builders to experiment and share what they make.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="submission">
    <div class="wrap cfp-details">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mono">A considered review</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Your perspective matters more than your title.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cfp-detail-copy">
        <p>We welcome first-time speakers, experienced practitioners, builders, and community voices. Keep the proposal focused on what the room can learn and apply.</p>
        <div class="notice">The CFP submission link, format, review timeline, and speaker support will be published when the event form is confirmed.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</EventLayout>

<style>
  .cfp-hero { padding-bottom: 76px; }
  .cfp-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; align-items: center; gap: 55px; }
  .cfp-hero h1 { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .cfp-hero p { max-width: 670px; }
  .cfp-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .cfp-banner { padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--blue); }
  .cfp-banner .mono { color: var(--yellow); }
  .cfp-banner h2 { margin: 18px 0 12px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .cfp-banner p { color: #d2d2d2; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .sessionize-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; color: var(--blue-soft); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .cfp-section-head { align-items: start; }
  .cfp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .cfp-card { min-height: 220px; padding: 27px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 5px solid var(--blue); background: var(--white); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .cfp-card.red-border { border-top-color: var(--red); }.cfp-card.yellow-border { border-top-color: var(--yellow); }
  .cfp-card .mono { color: var(--muted); }
  .cfp-card h3 { margin: 24px 0 10px; font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .cfp-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .cfp-details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 55px; align-items: start; }
  .cfp-detail-copy { padding-top: 13px; }
  .cfp-detail-copy p { margin-top: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .cfp-hero-grid, .cfp-details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 35px; }.cfp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .cfp-actions, .cfp-actions .button { width: 100%; }.cfp-banner { padding: 25px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--blue); }.cfp-card { min-height: 0; } }
</style>
